{"id":"vod_md_6269","vodId":"6269","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"链锯人","name_cn":"链锯人","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231025-1/ada1840dfdf6bbbcdca3041685c4a88e.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一个与现代社会相近，但充斥着被称为“恶魔”的怪物横行的世界。恶魔是带着动植物、概念等所有事物的名称而诞生，超越人类智慧的怪物。人们认为该名称越是恐怖，恶魔的力量就越大。恶魔可以通过补充人类的血液维持力量和治愈伤势。占据人类尸体的恶魔称为“魔人”，虽有人类的外貌，但人格是恶魔，仅有少数可保持理性的特例。恶魔猎人是指与恶魔缔结契约，以消灭恶魔为业的人，包括政府辖下的“公安对魔特异课”和民间的恶魔猎人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-25 09:10:53","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231024/n79MHEKz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231024/GD7XjeFw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231024/X3G9UImy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231024/75mFq2jR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231024/aCSCNxBm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231024/iduq2hLQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231024/RHVuLGsy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231024/cYr52BVn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231024/fQsAHHAG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231024/8j0lZYoX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231024/qDU9FeRC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231024/TLtQEfXG/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:07.616Z"}